<title>TURKEY: SOCCER-FENERBAHCE PLAYERS WILL GET $10,500 FOR WIN OVER UNITED.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-FENERBAHCE PLAYERS WILL GET $10,500 FOR WIN OVER UNITED.</headline>
<dateline>ISTANBUL 1996-10-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Fenerbahce players will get $10,500 each if they defeat Manchester United in their European Champions' League match at Old Trafford on Wednesday.</p>
<p>The club administration decided to raise the sum from $7,000 earlier this week. A draw will secure $3,500.</p>
<p>Fenerbahce lost 2-0 to the English champions in Istanbul on October 16.</p>
</text>
